{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39974","headline":"尚书荣拜恩命夤疾中輙课恶诗二首以申攀赞 一 · 徐夤","name":"尚书荣拜恩命夤疾中輙课恶诗二首以申攀赞 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明公家凿凤皇池，弱冠封侯四海推。\n富贵有期天授早，关河多难勅来迟。\n昴星人杰当王佐，黄石仙翁识帝师。\n昨日诏书犹漏缺，未言商也最能诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}